    "text": "By A Hazard Herald Staff Report ,\n6 hours ago During a special meeting Sept. 11, the Perry County Fiscal Court set its tax rate for the 2025 year and accepted the rates of the county's special taxing districts to be placed on bills. The fiscal court set the county's rate at 10.7 cents per $100 of assessed value on... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
